{% comment %}
题签 tiqian：古籍扉页的一个对开。文武边栏框住全页，版心（两条墨线夹一条竖带，上下鱼尾）把画面分成两页：右页标题竖排（朱雀仿宋、title 档），左页下方横排副题（lead）、落款与日期（note，日期等宽数字）。
竖排只给标题（单处不超过 16 字），副题、日期一律横排。朱色：无。入场：标题自上而下洇出，再出左页文字。
{% endcomment %}
<style>
  :scope {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: var(--ds-space-6) var(--ds-space-7);
    background: var(--ds-color-paper);
    color: var(--ds-color-ink);
    font-family: var(--ds-font-body);
    text-spacing-trim: trim-both;
  }
  :scope::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    mix-blend-mode: multiply;
    opacity: .45;
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='240' height='240'><filter id='n'><feTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='.85' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/><feColorMatrix values='0 0 0 0 .30 0 0 0 0 .24 0 0 0 0 .17 0 0 0 .16 0'/></filter><rect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)'/></svg>");
  }
  p, h1, h2, ol, ul, li, figure, figcaption, blockquote { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  p, li, blockquote { text-wrap: pretty; }
  h1, h2 { text-wrap: balance; }
  .frame {
    position: absolute;
    inset: var(--ds-space-5);
    border: 3px solid var(--ds-color-ink);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .frame::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: var(--ds-space-1);
    border: 1px solid var(--ds-color-rule);
  }
  .spread {
    position: absolute;
    inset: var(--ds-space-7) var(--ds-space-8);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr var(--ds-space-6) 1fr;
  }
  .left {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    padding-right: var(--ds-space-7);
  }
  .subtitle {
    font-size: var(--ds-type-lead);
    letter-spacing: .04em;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--ds-color-ink-2);
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .sign {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    margin-top: var(--ds-space-5);
    padding-top: var(--ds-space-3);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--ds-color-rule);
    font-size: var(--ds-type-note);
    letter-spacing: .12em;
  }
  .sign b { font-weight: 600; }
  .sign .date { font-feature-settings: "lnum" 1, "tnum" 1; letter-spacing: .06em; color: var(--ds-color-ink-2); }
  .banxin {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: var(--ds-space-2) 0;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--ds-color-ink);
    border-right: 1px solid var(--ds-color-ink);
  }
  .yuwei { width: 28px; fill: var(--ds-color-ink); }
  .right {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    padding-top: var(--ds-space-4);
  }
  .title {
    writing-mode: vertical-rl;
    text-orientation: upright;
    word-spacing: -.75em;
    max-height: 7.4em;
    text-wrap: balance;
    font-size: var(--ds-type-title);
    font-family: var(--ds-font-latin), var(--ds-font-cjk-display);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: .16em;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .subtitle:has(> :empty) { display: none; }
</style>
<div class="frame"></div>
<div class="spread">
  <div class="left">
    <p class="subtitle" data-ds-enter="fade" data-ds-step="ink" data-ds-ease="ink" data-ds-order="2">{{ slots.subtitle }}</p>
    <div class="sign" data-ds-enter="fade" data-ds-step="ink" data-ds-ease="ink" data-ds-order="3"><b>{{ slots.presenter }}</b><span class="date">{{ slots.date }}</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="banxin" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="yuwei" viewBox="0 0 24 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 0H24V10L17 5.5L12 11.5L7 5.5L0 10Z"/></svg><svg class="yuwei" viewBox="0 0 24 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 16H24V6L17 10.5L12 4.5L7 10.5L0 6Z"/></svg></div>
  <div class="right">
    <h1 class="title" data-ds-enter="fall" data-ds-step="glide" data-ds-ease="paper" data-ds-distance="3" data-ds-order="1">{{ slots.title }}</h1>
  </div>
</div>
